1
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,380
I never would have imagined

2
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,300
that I'd be standing in the spotlight,

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,180
standing in front of everyone.

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,100
Would you like to join the swim club?

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,060
It's totally fine if you can't swim!

6
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,100
Seriously, it's fine.
We love beginners!

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,720
No one who knew me in high school

8
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,940
is here.

9
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,060
I'm going to completely reinvent myself
in college!

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,440
Beginners are totally welcome!

11
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,520
Come check us out!

12
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,610
Not you!

13
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,610
Soccer club!

14
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:33,320
Beginners are welcome!
You've got to come!

15
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:45,130
(Ugh, what on earth am I doing?)

16
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:47,420
(At this rate, it'll be just like high school.)

17
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,050
(No, I can't run away!)

18
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:51,010
(First, I need to calm down!)

19
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:04,360
Destiny is not decided by the stars.

20
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:17,290
- Hey, you.
- Huh?

21
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:18,830
Are you talking to me?

22
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:20,620
Well, yeah.
There's no one else here.

23
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,000
Say that again.

24
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
That line you just said.

25
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:25,540
Huh?

26
00:01:25,810 --> 00:01:28,460
The one about destiny not being decided by the stars.

27
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:30,920
Oh, that... well...

28
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,630
You have real talent!

29
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:33,930
What?!

30
00:01:33,930 --> 00:01:35,970
- What do you mean?
- You're going to be a great actor.

31
00:01:39,310 --> 00:01:41,520
You'll definitely make
a fantastic actor!

32
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,730
No, wait...

33
00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:45,020
That's impossible. I could never do that.

34
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,530
I finally found you.

35
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,820
Whoa...!

36
00:01:56,490 --> 00:01:58,200
Are you serious?
What was that all about?

37
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,200
Are you okay?

38
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,330
Hahaha.

39
00:02:02,830 --> 00:02:05,500
(I guess I really can't do this...)

40
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:13,760
If music be the food of love,

41
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:16,640
play on.

42
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,850
Give me excess of it,

43
00:02:18,850 --> 00:02:19,890
(Ah...)

44
00:02:19,890 --> 00:02:22,180
that, surfeiting,

45
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:24,640
- the appetite may sicken
- (That person...)

46
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:27,110
and so die.

47
00:02:27,110 --> 00:02:28,520
Oh, excuse me...

48
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:31,230
I've been waiting for you.

49
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:34,570
Destiny is not decided by the stars.

50
00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:36,070
Huh?
